sis":"原纪年逐项对读；不从邻段继承绝对年份。","evidence":["wgc-q0694","wgc-q0131"]},"ordering_evidence":"wgc-q0694"}],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0141","name":"诸葛绪","evidence":["shaodi-q-o166","jfj-q0183","wgc-q0043","wgc-q0070","wgc-q0076","wgc-q0131","wgc-q0046","wgc-q0468"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o166-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o166"]},{"id":"jfj-m-o050-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段人物记载：诸葛绪","evidence":["jfj-q0183"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o055-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0043"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o091-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0070"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o100-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0076"]},{"id":"wgc-m-p052-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0131"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o062-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0046"]},{"id":"wgc-m-o101-shaodi-p0141","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及诸葛绪","evidence":["wgc-q0468"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"jfj-q0183","section":"chapter-044","block":"b-8ae28042edaf54c8a788","layer":"original","quote":"及钟会将向骆谷，邓艾将入沓中；然后乃遣右车骑廖化诣沓中为维援〖5〗，左车骑张翼、辅国大将军董厥等诣阳安关口以为诸围外助〖6〗。比至阴平，闻魏将诸葛绪向建威，故住待之。","section_title":"蒋琬费祎姜维传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0094.xhtml","index":229,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":83,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-dab8228669bc5cb2230e","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-b6e42f6564b8a81703c8","layer":"original","quote":"以陇西太守随邓艾伐蜀有功","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":260,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":28,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o166a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b237d0439beadd09325c","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，诏曰：“蜀，蕞尔小国〖2〗，土狭民寡。而姜维虐用其众，曾无废志〖3〗。往岁破败之后，犹复耕种沓中〖4〗，刻剥众羌，劳役无已，民不堪命。夫‘兼弱攻昧〖5〗，武之善经’；‘致人而不致于人〖6〗’，兵家之上略。蜀所恃赖，唯维而已；因其远离巢窟〖7〗，用力为易。今使征西将军邓艾督帅诸军，趋甘松、沓中以罗取维〖8〗；雍州刺史诸葛绪督诸军，趋（武都、高楼）〔武街、桥头〕〖9〗：首尾蹴讨。若擒维，便当东西并进，扫灭巴蜀也。”又命镇西将军钟会由骆谷伐蜀〖10〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":229,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-ded6d700dc6f860d1670","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：景元四年（公元 263）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":201,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-ef642248e44d01f3825d","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o165","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b35fdf03685051716720","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，复命大将军进位、爵赐，一如前诏。又固辞，乃止。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":32,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o166","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b237d0439beadd09325c","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，诏曰：“蜀，蕞尔小国〖2〗，土狭民寡。而姜维虐用其众，曾无废志〖3〗。往岁破败之后，犹复耕种沓中〖4〗，刻剥众羌，劳役无已，民不堪命。夫‘兼弱攻昧〖5〗，武之善经’；‘致人而不致于人〖6〗’，兵家之上略。蜀所恃赖，唯维而已；因其远离巢窟〖7〗，用力为易。今使征西将军邓艾督帅诸军，趋甘松、沓中以罗取维〖8〗；雍州刺史诸葛绪督诸军，趋（武都、高楼）〔武街、桥头〕〖9〗：首尾蹴讨。若擒维，便当东西并进，扫灭巴蜀也。”又命镇西将军钟会由骆谷伐蜀〖10〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":195,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":229,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0043","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7aa260ba6c445f9f0967","layer":"original","quote":"毌丘俭作乱，遣健步赍书〖1〗，欲疑惑大众〖2〗；艾斩之，兼道进军〖3〗。先趣乐嘉城，作浮桥；司马景王至，遂据之。文钦以后大军〖4〗，破败于城下；艾追之至丘头，钦奔吴。吴大将军孙峻等号十万众，将渡江，镇东将军诸葛诞遣艾据肥阳〖5〗；艾以与贼势相远，非要害之地；辄移屯附亭〖6〗，遣泰山太守诸葛绪等，于黎浆拒战〖7〗，遂走之。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":161,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0046","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋，诏诸军征蜀，大将军司马文王皆指授节度。使艾与维相缀连〖2〗，雍州刺史诸葛绪邀维〖3〗：令不得归。艾遣天水太守王颀等直攻维营，陇西太守牵弘等邀其前，金城太守杨欣等诣甘松〖4〗。维闻钟会诸军已入汉中，引退还。欣等追蹑于强川口〖5〗，大战。维败走。闻雍州已塞道〖6〗，屯桥头〖7〗；从孔函谷入北道〖8〗，欲出雍州后。诸葛绪闻之，却还三十里〖9〗。维入北道三十余里，闻绪军却，寻还，从桥头过；绪趋截维，较一日不及〖10〗。维遂东引，还守剑阁〖11〗。钟会攻维未能克。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":233,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0070","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a8c7cff17ae8b7e5d8a8","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋〖1〗，乃下诏使邓艾、诸葛绪各统诸军三万余人：艾趋甘松、沓中，连缀维；绪趋武街，桥头〖2〗，绝维归路。会统十余万众，分从斜谷、骆谷入〖3〗。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":73,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0076","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-e3e892ba497cf66aa3a6","layer":"original","quote":"邓艾追姜维到阴平，简选精锐；欲从汉德阳入江由、左担道，诣绵竹〖1〗，趋成都，与诸葛绪共行。绪以本受节度邀姜维，西行非本诏；遂进军前向白水，与会合。会遣将军田章等从剑阁西，径出江由。未至百里，章先破蜀伏兵三校〖2〗；艾使章先登。遂长驱而前。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0131","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a25c3980614d9cbc344c","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞按《百官名》：“绪入晋为太常、崇礼卫尉。子冲，廷尉。”荀绰《兖州记》曰：“冲子铨，字德林，玫字仁林：铨，兖州刺史；玫，侍中、御史中丞。”","attribution":"百官名；荀绰兖州记","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":554,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5146323d31eb1ac0f25d","start":0,"end":71,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0352","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-7aa260ba6c445f9f0967","layer":"original","quote":"艾以与贼势相远，非要害之地；辄移屯附亭〖6〗，遣泰山太守诸葛绪等，于黎浆拒战〖7〗，遂走之","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":295,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":115,"end":160,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0370","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"使艾与维相缀连〖2〗，雍州刺史诸葛绪邀维〖3〗：令不得归","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":51,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0375","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"诸葛绪闻之，却还三十里〖9〗。维入北道三十余里，闻绪军却，寻还，从桥头过","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":159,"end":195,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0376","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-23e8850b8ee57e7e439c","layer":"original","quote":"绪趋截维，较一日不及","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":322,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":196,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0449","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a8c7cff17ae8b7e5d8a8","layer":"original","quote":"四年秋〖1〗，乃下诏使邓艾、诸葛绪各统诸军三万余人：艾趋甘松、沓中，连缀维；绪趋武街，桥头〖2〗，绝维归路","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":471,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0464","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-e3e892ba497cf66aa3a6","layer":"original","quote":"绪以本受节度邀姜维，西行非本诏；遂进军前向白水，与会合","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0467","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c0dc2458d677fcaed01f","layer":"original","quote":"会与绪军向剑阁。会欲专军势，密白绪畏懦不进；槛车征还，军悉属会","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":530,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0468","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-c0dc2458d677fcaed01f","layer":"original","quote":"会与绪军向剑阁。会欲专军势，密白绪畏懦不进；槛车征还，军悉属会。﹝一﹞进攻剑阁，不克，引退。蜀军保险拒守。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":530,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0694","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-a25c3980614d9cbc344c","layer":"pei","quote":"绪入晋为太常、崇礼卫尉。","attribution":"百官名；荀绰兖州记","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":554,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5146323d31eb1ac0f25d","start":11,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
